        },
        {
          "id": "i-cv-X6MlNgTtER6HnT-X",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787545549950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In \"software engineering\": web dev\n    -> system design for users of an application, backend: server logic, ... frontend: typescript ... deployment is on the web!\n\nIn \"data engineering/science/analytics\": data dev\n    -> system design for data intensive applications, backend ~ database(s), ... frontend: \"BI\" (business intelligence) ...\ndeployment is on a server with an api endpoint exposed or visualized on a platform",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In \"software engineering\": web dev\n    -> system design for users of an application, backend: server logic, ... frontend: typescript ... deployment is on the web!\n\nIn \"data engineering/science/analytics\": data dev\n    -> system design for data intensive applications, backend ~ database(s), ... frontend: \"BI\" (business intelligence) ... deployment is on a server with an api endpoint exposed or visualized on a platform",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
